# ===============================
# Build Artifacts
# ===============================
apps/*/server
apps/core/bin/
*.so
*.dylib

# Generated protobuf/grpc code (reproduce with `make proto` / `buf generate`).
# The gen/go MODULE METADATA below is the exception: apps/core/go.mod has
# `replace .../gen/go => ../../gen/go`, so a clean clone cannot resolve the
# module at all unless go.mod/go.sum are present. buf generate emits only
# *.pb.go — it never writes these two files.
#
# Note: `gen/*` rather than `gen/` — git cannot re-include a path whose
# parent directory is excluded, so the parent must stay traversable.
gen/*
!gen/go/
gen/go/*
!gen/go/go.mod
!gen/go/go.sum

